host Vultr SEA NixOS VPS ai-jail pier (Daylight DC-1 hand) -- Eastern (EDT)
title Caravan intent -- a grant is a ceiling, a hop is an act, and a word is safe once you hand it over
prompt Keaton set the autonomous loop running -- pick up the running thread Lindy-first crux-first, Standfast on reds first, take the next agent-doable lap, prove it on metal, and send it as its own signed round.
think Standfast first. The living REDS rows (80, 83, 84, 85, and the prose notes 81, 86, 87) all read closed, with 85 reopened and closed again on 20260819 behind a real loom. No open agent-closable red stood in the way, so the line was clear for constructive work.
think The running thread came straight from the newest log's recommend line: the grant is an upper bound rather than an act, so a domain holding rw on a region it only reads this turn still orders every reader behind it -- and the question is whether an item may declare the direction of its own hop without letting a supervisor take it at its word.
think The answer separates into two readings of one declaration. An item carries one letter per hop, r or w. The supervisor SCHEDULES by those letters, and it also HANDS THEM OUT AS THE LINE -- the child's capability words narrowed to exactly what it declared. The second reading is what makes the first one safe, and the whole rung is that sentence.
think The effective write is the grant AND the word, in that order, so a declaration narrows and never widens. An item declaring w on a region the document grants it read-only writes nothing and orders nobody. Trust flows one way only.
think A real seam opened where the narrowing met the elder boot check. boot.line_agrees asks a handed line to EQUAL the declaration, which is exactly right when the line IS the derivation -- and it refuses a narrowed line for being too careful. Safety never asked for equality; it asked for a ceiling. So boot.line_within was added beside it, and cohort's spawn was split rather than weakened: spawn_one_extra keeps the strong assert for every rung that hands a derived line, spawn_one_within carries the ceiling for this one, and the body is shared whole.
think The isolation room was asked honestly and answered nothing. A channel joins two domains at every instant they both run, and a bell may ring at any moment of a hop, so a per-hop word narrows what a child touches and narrows no standing joint. Rather than convert it for symmetry, admissible delegates to commute's grant reading under every reading and the doc names the reason.
obs The finding is one sentence with a hinge in the middle: a supervisor may take an item at its word exactly when it hands the word out as the line. Read the letters for scheduling alone and you have the control; read them twice and the declaration is required rather than believed.
obs Over the ceiling lap the order half converts whole. The grants take no lawful pass at all -- the virtualiser's rw on the published region orders every reader behind it -- while reading the act takes 2 lawful passes reaching 3 items back, fills the table to 3 where the grants held it at 2, and leaves 3 slot-turns unspent against 6. Five children run to the same end under both.
obs The narrowing is measurable rather than rhetorical: the virtualiser holds 7 capabilities and is handed 1, read alone, on the lap where it only looks. boot.line_within holds for that line and boot.line_agrees fails for it, which is the proof the narrowing is real.
obs Both RED paths proven on metal before any GREEN claim. Run the ceiling lap by grant under the act's own checks and it reds at no item passing an rw holder that only looks, so the conversion is real work. Remove the narrowing and hand the full line under the act's own reading, and the lie lap reds identically to the control -- the narrowing is the whole of the safety rather than an ornament on it.
obs The control breaks where the document said it would: an item declaring r on a region it then writes is taken at its word, the write lands, and the child answers carried where its own declaration said WriteDenied. Faster and wrong, measured rather than argued.
obs Reuse over restatement held again -- commute.writes, commute.items_contend, commute.admissible, overtake.share_a_hop, overtake.Report, cohort.spawn_one and reap_one all asked rather than restated, so this rung's numbers stand beside commute's unconverted. The supervisor loop is commute's program differing in which table it hands over.
obs Thirty green-witnessed Rye rings now carry the Microkit shape across real processes. TAME surface GREEN -- style bans clean, width-check exit 0 -- and every neighbor the shared spawn seam touches re-GREEN: boot, cohort, rolling, overtake, commute, harvest, concurrent.
obs Council rota lap 470 mod 27 = 11 -- single-stranded, read deep. It shaped the seam decision directly: rather than braiding two guarantees into one weakened assert, the spawn was composed into two free-standing ones, each about one thing, so the elder rungs keep equality and this one gets its ceiling.
loom witness=caravan_intent ceiling_slots_by_grant=6 ceiling_slots_by_act=3 passes_by_grant=0 passes_by_act=2 pass_reach=3 peak_by_grant=2 peak_by_act=3 children=5 caps_held=7 caps_handed=1
file caravan/intent.rye the rung -- per-hop declarations, the effective write as grant AND word, the narrowed line, and three readings over one program
file caravan/boot.rye line_within added beside line_agrees -- the ceiling reading a narrowed line needs, which equality was refusing
file caravan/cohort.rye spawn split into spawn_one_extra (asserts agreement) and spawn_one_within (asserts the ceiling), body shared whole
file tools/caravan_intent_witness.rish the witness -- native contains checks, every printed number pinned, both RED paths named
file caravan/README.md the rung registered in the table and its own section, ahead of Held
file crux/REMEMBER.md git nib and living edge moved to this rung
recommend keep-going the honest next crux is what a per-hop word still cannot reach -- the letters describe one whole hop, so an item that reads a region for most of its turn and writes it once at the end declares w and orders every reader behind it for the whole hop, and the question becomes whether a turn may be cut into phases a supervisor can schedule between without the declaration growing a second dialect
